    "detailed_description": "In Sexy Apocalypse Girls you will play as Liam, who is desperately trying to survive and find his place in this dangerous and crazy new reality. He will meet different characters from hot beautiful girls to suspicious murky guys along the way. Who can you truly trust? Only you and your decisions will affect the fate of the main character.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754140/extras/d7efd609e00a15036dc6dcd6b70e02a1.avif?t=1726177323\" width=600 height=222 /></span><br>The plot of the game takes place after a year of a devastating pandemic. Only a small fraction of the world's population survived. Many people have turned into wild animals for getting food and basic resources, while others have tried to retain their humanity in hopes of finding shelter and a better life. Does a peaceful life exist in a post-apocalypse world or is it just a way to believe in something?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754140/extras/b7aaf726269b2250c0fdff406212bbcc.avif?t=1726177323\" width=600 height=219 /></span><br>In the game you will find:<br><br> \u2043 Diverse Locations;<br> \u2043 Juicy and colourful pictures that will immerse you in a world of zombies and post-apocalypse;<br> \u2043 Exciting plot with many unexpected twists and turns;<br> \u2043 And, of course, spicy romantic scenes that will provide real pleasure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2754140/extras/ca7833bb431eb7c60f91c4ce8852129d.avif?t=1726177323\" width=622 height=450 /></span>",
